	"version"		"3"
	"revision"		"1"
	"title"		"PokeMMO - Xbox (full parity)"
	"description"		"Native-feel PokeMMO layout, keyboard+mouse parity. Stick/d-pad move, A confirm, B cancel, X Bag, Y Hotbar 1, Start Game Menu, LB/RB tabs, RT/LT left/right click, right stick mouse, R3 chat, L3 keyboard. Hold View: d-pad Hotbar 2-5, ABXY Hotbar 6-9, right stick Pokedex/Incubators/Team/Trainer, Start GTL, LB Screenshot, L3 Friends, R3 Hide GUI, LT/RT Key X/Y. Strictly 1 input = 1 key."
